&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Summary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is designed for seasoned portfolio advisors with deep expertise in multi-asset solutions and HNI-specific needs. You will be responsible for providing sophisticated portfolio construction and advisory, including complex structures like succession, tax optimisation, and multi-entity strategies.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise on bespoke portfolios integrating MF, PMS, AIF, Bonds, Structured/Global Products.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and redesign existing portfolios, addressing allocation,selection, and deployment&amp;nbsp;gaps.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply advanced solutions for UHNIs including cash flow planning,preservation strategies,&amp;nbsp;estate planning, and taxation nuances.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously monitor client portfolios and recommend rebalancing actions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a thought partner to relationship teams on large/complex clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Candidate Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years’ experience in wealth advisory for UHNI or Family Office clients.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In-depth knowledge of structured products, global funds, and advanced tax/regulatory&amp;nbsp;frameworks.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CFA/CA/MBA Finance preferred.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High client engagement and consultative skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
